---
description: README structure for apps and packages
globs: "**/README.md"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Simple, succinct, technical, factual; active voice
- Root README owns the Basilic product story; other READMEs do not repeat it
- Capability names match `apps/docu` architecture overview
- Lean with links to the docs site; no duplication of MDX
- Follow `.agents/skills/technical-writing/` when rewriting public READMEs
- Structure:
 - Root: discover → understand → try → explore (not a script encyclopedia)
 - Apps: Description → fit → Links to docs → pnpm commands
 - Packages: Description → Usage → Links to docs → pnpm commands